<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Anniversary Avinash ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff5f9e,#ffc6d9);
text-align:center;
color:white;
overflow-x:hidden;
}

header{
padding:60px 20px;
}

h1{
font-size:42px;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
margin-top:10px;
}

button{
margin-top:25px;
padding:15px 35px;
font-size:20px;
background:#fff;
color:#ff4081;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
cursor:pointer;
font-weight:bold;
}

.gallery{
display:none;
padding:30px;
}

.gallery img{
width:90%;
max-width:350px;
border-radius:20px;
margin:20px auto;
display:block;
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.5);
}

.letter{
display:none;
padding:25px;
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.8;
}

.final{
display:none;
padding:50px;
font-size:30px;
font-weight:bold;
}

.heart{
position:fixed;
top:-20px;
color:red;
animation:fall 8s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes fall{
0%{transform:translateY(-20px);}
100%{transform:translateY(110vh);}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>

<h1> Happy 1st Anniversary  nannaaa💝</h1>

<p>Avinash 💗Mallika</p>

<button onclick="nextPage()">Click To Begin ❤️</button>

</header>
<div class="gallery" id="gallery">

<h2>💖 Our Beautiful Memories 💖</h2>

<img src="photo1.jpg" alt="Photo 1">
<p>💗 Every moment with you is my favorite memory.</p>

<img src="photo2.jpg" alt="Photo 2">
<p>💝 Every smile we share becomes a beautiful chapter in our love story.</p>

<img src="photo3.jpg" alt="Photo 3">
<p>💕 No matter where life takes us, my heart will always choose you.</p>

<button onclick="showLetter()">💌 Read My Letter</button>

</div>

<div class="letter" id="letter">

<h2>💌 To My Dearest Avinash 💌</h2>

<p>

Happy First Anniversary, my love. ❤️

You are the most valuable person in this world to me.

I always loved you.

Through every hardship, I will never leave your hand.

Thank you for filling my life with happiness, love and unforgettable memories.

No matter what happens in life, my heart will always choose you.

I LOVE YOU SO MUCH.

💖 I LOVE YOU FOREVER NANNAAAAA 💖

Forever Yours,

Mallika ❤️

</p>

<button onclick="showFinal()">💖 One Last Surprise</button>

</div>

<div class="final" id="final">

<h1> I LOVE YOU FOREVER NANNAAAAA 💗</h1>

<h2> Happy 1st Anniversary 🌹</h2>

<h2>Avinash ❤️ Mallika</h2>

<p>Forever & Always 💕</p>

</div>

<script>

function nextPage(){
document.querySelector("header").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("gallery").style.display="block";
}

function showLetter(){
document.getElementById("gallery").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";
}

function showFinal(){
document.getElementById("letter").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("final").style.display="block";

for(let i=0;i<50;i++){
let h=document.createElement("div");
h.className="heart";
h.innerHTML="💖";
h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
h.style.animationDuration=(Math.random()*5+3)+"s";
document.body.appendChild(h);
}
}

</script>

</body>
</html>
